\ Changing the month lengths requires a fresh memo namespace.
\ Each call to Count all possible month weavings rebuilds the month
\ state and clears the previous cache. Alternating configurations must
\ not reuse an old suffix count with the same remaining-count vector.
\ Alternating ranks must never consume the input month lengths.

To check changing month weaving configurations:
  Prepare two synthetic months.
  Count all possible month weavings.
  If the weaving selection's total completions is not "20",
    put "The first two-month total is wrong." into the check report; exit.
  Put 1 into the weaving selection's preserve full weaving.
  Put "20" into a configuration rank wide quantity.
  Select a weaving selection from the configuration rank wide quantity.
  Write the selected weaving as test text.
  If the woven test text is not "12221112",
    put "The last two-month rank was selected incorrectly." into the check report; exit.
  Prepare three synthetic months.
  Count all possible month weavings.
  If the weaving selection's total completions is not "1301",
    put "The three-month total was polluted by the previous memo." into the check report; exit.
  Put "1301" into the configuration rank wide quantity.
  Select a weaving selection from the configuration rank wide quantity.
  Write the selected weaving as test text.
  If the woven test text is not "123332211123",
    put "Three-month unranking reused the two-month state." into the check report; exit.
  Put "0" into the configuration rank wide quantity.
  Select a weaving selection from the configuration rank wide quantity.
  If the weaving selection's selection success is not 0,
    put "Invalid rank zero was accepted after a successful selection." into the check report; exit.
  Prepare two synthetic months.
  Count all possible month weavings.
  If the weaving selection's total completions is not "20",
    put "Returning to two months reused the three-month memo." into the check report; exit.
  Put "10" into the configuration rank wide quantity.
  Select a weaving selection from the configuration rank wide quantity.
  Write the selected weaving as test text.
  If the woven test text is not "11222112",
    put "Returning to two months produced a stale weaving." into the check report; exit.
  If the weaving selection's recursion depth is not 0,
    put "Repeated configurations leaked recursion depth." into the check report; exit.
